{"id":"541d135aa71db996","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-measure3-convergence-in-measure.md","title":"ZFC Measure3 Convergence In Measure","display":"df-zfc-measure3-convergence-in-measure — ZFC Measure3 Convergence In Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure3-convergence-in-measure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure3-convergence-in-measure"],"display":"df-zfc-measure3-convergence-in-measure — ZFC Measure3 Convergence In Measure","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","[[58-df-measurable-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure3-convergence-in-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure3-convergence-in-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure3-convergence-in-measure — ZFC Measure3 Convergence In Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"58-df-measurable-function\">58-df-measurable-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\">\\((X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\)</span> (measure space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec f\\in(\\mathbb R^X)^\\omega\">\\(\\vec f\\in(\\mathbb R^X)^\\omega\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathbb R^X\">\\(f\\in\\mathbb R^X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\)</span> (measure-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S\\)</span> (real measurable-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"58-df-measurable-function\">58-df-measurable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConvergesInMeasure}\">\\(\\operatorname{ConvergesInMeasure}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}in\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\operatorname{ConvergesInMeasure}(\\vec f,f;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land\\vec f\\in(\\mathbb R^X)^\\omega\\land f\\in\\mathbb R^X\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\Sigma,f)\\land\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\vec f(n))\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\varepsilon,\\eta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to\\mu\\{x\\in X:|\\vec f(n)(x)-f(x)|&gt;\\varepsilon\\}&lt;\\eta)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}in\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\operatorname{ConvergesInMeasure}(\\vec f,f;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land\\vec f\\in(\\mathbb R^X)^\\omega\\land f\\in\\mathbb R^X\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\Sigma,f)\\land\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\vec f(n))\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\varepsilon,\\eta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to\\mu\\{x\\in X:|\\vec f(n)(x)-f(x)|&gt;\\varepsilon\\}&lt;\\eta)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The epsilon-eta form expands the limit and makes the measurability of every function explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measurable-function","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measurable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S$ (measure-space predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measurable-function","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S$ (real measurable-function predicate, see [[58-df-measurable-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec f\\in(\\mathbb R^X)^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathbb R^X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ConvergesInMeasure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}in\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\operatorname{ConvergesInMeasure}(\\vec f,f;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land\\vec f\\in(\\mathbb R^X)^\\omega\\land f\\in\\mathbb R^X\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\Sigma,f)\\land\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\vec f(n))\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\varepsilon,\\eta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to\\mu\\{x\\in X:|\\vec f(n)(x)-f(x)|>\\varepsilon\\}<\\eta)","display":true}],"bytes":1515,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2579","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-measure3-convergence-in-measure.md|58-df-zfc-measure3-convergence-in-measure]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["83a15c7e9b3817dc","bbbec05fde1d3b01"]}